    "C": "$\\frac{1}{2\\pi t_{0}}\\cos^{- 1}(\\frac{2a + 3c}{b})$",
    "D": "$\\frac{1}{2\\pi t_{0}}\\cos^{- 1}(\\frac{a + 2b}{3c})$"
  },
  "answer": {
